### --- Variaveis ---
### Assumir que voce tem um token admin valido
### e pelo menos um especialista criado (F04/F05)

@base_url = http://localhost:8080
@token = SEU_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
@specialist_id = SEU_SPECIALIST_ID_AQUI

### =============================================
### F15 — Tools do Especialista (Admin)
### =============================================
###
### Cada especialista pode ter um subconjunto de tools
### associadas. Os steps opcionalmente forcam ou
### restringem tools por etapa do atendimento.
###
### Tools disponiveis (registradas no startup):
###   data_query:
###     - search_leads
###     - get_lead_detail
###     - get_conversation_history
###     - list_products
###     - get_pipeline
###   crm_action:
###     - move_lead
###     - create_note
###     - update_score
###   automation:
###     - trigger_automation
###     - switch_specialist

### Renderiza a secao de tools do especialista
### (agrupadas por categoria, com estado associado/disponivel)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools
Cookie: token={{token}}

### HTMX: retorna somente o fragmento para swap
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools
Cookie: token={{token}}
HX-Request: true

### Associar uma tool ao especialista
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

tool_name=search_leads

### Associar tool de acao no CRM
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

tool_name=move_lead

### Associar tool de automacao
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

tool_name=trigger_automation

### Tentar associar tool ja associada (deve retornar 400)
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

tool_name=search_leads

### Tentar associar sem tool_name (deve retornar 400)
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

tool_name=

### Desassociar uma tool
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools/search_leads
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Tentar desassociar tool nao associada (deve retornar 400)
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools/search_leads
Cookie: token={{token}}

### =============================================
### Testes OWASP
### =============================================

### A01 — Sem token (deve retornar 401)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools

### A01 — Token de usuario comum (deve retornar 403)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools
Cookie: token=TOKEN_USER_AQUI

### A07 — Token invalido (deve retornar 401)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools
Cookie: token=invalid.token.here

### A03 — Tentar associar tool com nome malicioso
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

tool_name='; DROP TABLE specialist_tools; --

### A03 — Path traversal no nome da tool
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/tools/..%2F..%2Fadmin
Cookie: token={{token}}
